# ─── CSA Laser storefront env ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Local dev: leave everything empty. The web app calls same-origin "/api"
# and Vite proxies it to the dev API on http://127.0.0.1:3000.
#
# Production (Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables): point the storefront
# at the Spring Boot backend origin (NO trailing slash, NO /api suffix):
#   VITE_API_URL=https://csa-laser-api.onrender.com
# NOTE: Vite inlines VITE_* vars at BUILD time — redeploy after changing it.

# VITE_API_URL=
